# SIH PS26117: Sovereign On-Premise Agentic AI Workbench - Backend

This backend implements the Sovereign On-Premise Agentic AI Workbench Gateway according to the architecture in `docs/SIH26117.md`.

## Key Features

1. **Air-Gapped & Zero-Egress Guarantee**:
   - `ZeroEgressInterceptorMiddleware` traps requests, verifies local origin, and enforces zero external egress.
   - Auditing logs with SHA-256 hashes and verifiable provenance in SQLite.

2. **Multimodal Document Ingestion Pipeline**:
   - PDF & document extraction using PyMuPDF (`fitz`).
   - Semantic chunking (512 tokens with 50-token overlap).
   - Dense embeddings with local Ollama (`nomic-embed-text`) & ChromaDB vector store.

3. **Bilateral Real-Time Agent State Machine**:
   - WebSocket bilateral endpoint at `WS /api/v1/agents/ws/{session_id}`.
   - Thought emission (`event: thought`), tool calls (`event: tool_call`), tool results (`event: tool_result`), and citations (`event: final_answer`).

4. **Air-Gapped Subprocess / Docker Code Sandbox**:
   - Execution endpoint `POST /api/v1/sandbox/execute` with timeout and memory enforcement.
   - Automatic artifact tracking and download endpoint at `GET /api/v1/artifacts/download/{filename}`.

5. **CAD & P&ID Schematic Vision Pipeline**:
   - Vision endpoint `POST /api/v1/vision/analyze` utilizing Qwen 2-VL with 2D spatial bounding box annotations `[ymin, xmin, ymax, xmax]`.

6. **System & GPU Telemetry**:
   - `GET /api/v1/system/health` returning GPU VRAM, network isolation status, and loaded Ollama models.
   - `GET /api/v1/audit/traces` for compliance logs.

---

## Directory Structure

```
backend/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py                     # FastAPI entrypoint, middleware, lifespan
│   ├── config.py                   # Pydantic Settings
│   ├── database.py                 # SQLite database & async sessionmaker
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── sql_models.py           # SQLAlchemy SQLite tables
│   │   └── schemas.py              # Pydantic data contracts
│   ├── api/
│   │   └── v1/
│   │       ├── api_router.py       # API v1 aggregator
│   │       └── endpoints/
│   │           ├── workspaces.py   # Workspace CRUD
│   │           ├── documents.py    # Document upload & status
│   │           ├── agent_ws.py     # WebSocket bilateral agent stream
│   │           ├── vision.py       # Schematic / CAD vision
│   │           ├── sandbox.py      # Code sandbox execution
│   │           ├── telemetry.py    # System health & telemetry
│   │           ├── audit.py        # Air-gap audit traces
│   │           └── artifacts.py    # Generated artifacts download
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── zero_egress.py          # Zero-Egress Interceptor Middleware
│   │   └── security.py             # Hash utilities & ID generators
│   └── services/
│       ├── ingestion_service.py    # PDF parsing & chunking
│       ├── vector_store.py         # ChromaDB client & vector search
│       ├── ollama_client.py        # Ollama local LLM / VLM client
│       ├── sandbox_service.py      # Code execution runner
│       ├── vision_service.py       # Schematic vision analyzer
│       └── agent_engine.py         # ReAct agent loop
├── storage/
│   ├── uploads/                    # Uploaded documents
│   ├── artifacts/                  # Generated plots/CSVs
│   └── chroma_db/                  # ChromaDB vector index
├── requirements.txt
├── pyproject.toml
└── .env.example
```

